{"id": "|0710D3184196D89ADAFB36800B6A3BD4", "source_en": "Set display resolution. Affects window size in Windowed mode and output in Fullscreen. Some resolutions may show black bars.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط دقة العرض. يؤثر ذلك على حجم النافذة في وضع النافذة وعلى المخرجات في وضع ملء الشاشة. قد تظهر بعض الدقات كأشرطة سوداء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "|002AC6544DDA2A7F33BAF9B4A6CEADCC", "source_en": "Set other players in multiplayer to muted by default. You can override this per player when playing together.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "كتم صوت اللاعبين الآخرين في وضع اللعب الجماعي افتراضيًا. يمكنك تغيير هذا الإعداد لكل لاعب على حدة عند اللعب معًا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "|E98B2A284B6D98365CEF788144199CBB", "source_en": "Set the dead zone to prevent accidental movement.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط المنطقة الميتة لمنع الحركة غير المقصودة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "|073D6AB44FC03064C936A89EA2D9FC29", "source_en": "Set the dead zone to prevent unintended camera/player movement.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضبط المنطقة الميتة لمنع حركة الكاميرا أو اللاعب غير المقصودة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "|CB9803EC4D52D6B5530FBABA297AE1E2", "source_en": "Sets the resolution at which objects render. Lower values boost performance but reduce clarity.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "يحدد الدقة التي يتم بها عرض الأجسام. القيم المنخفضة تحسن الأداء ولكنها تقلل من الوضوح.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "|937271514B63C152EBFBF5B6870FDE2C", "source_en": "Sets the resolution of in-game textures. Higher settings improve detail but can reduce performance.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "يحدد دقة الأنسجة داخل اللعبة. الإعدادات العالية تحسن التفاصيل ولكنها قد تقلل من الأداء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
